  partName: Clip (3)
  description: The Clip (3) is a tiny, complex component located at the top-center-center
    of the engine, constructed from Material.001, responsible for securing hoses,
    wires, and other critical engine components, preventing damage and ensuring proper
    function. Its complex shape allows for flexible and secure attachment, and its
    central position enables easy access for maintenance and repairs. Notably, the
    Clip (3) is designed to be easily removable and reusable, reducing maintenance
    time and costs.
